      "text": "Result: \nBecause the functionality of pairing groups is not built\ninto the app you either need some very elaborate bot\nwhich is typically not very UX friendly or somehow\norganize groups some other way meaning using Discord\ndoes not address a core problem of facilitation effort\nwhen it comes to using it in Study Groups",
